  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふかいきりで　てきを　まどわせ\nじめつさせる　おそろしさを　もつ。\nかいりゅうが　エネルギーの　みなもと。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "짙은 안개로 적을 혼란시켜\n자멸하게 만드는 무서움을 지녔다.\n해류가 에너지의 근원이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "擁有利用濃霧迷惑敵人，\n讓其自我毀滅的可怕能力。\n海流是其能量的來源。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il confond ses ennemis grâce au brouillard\net les pousse à s’en prendre à eux-mêmes.\nIl puise son énergie dans les courants marins.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es führt Gegner mit dichtem Nebel in die Irre\nund schickt sie so in ihren Untergang. Seine\nEnergie gewinnt es aus der Meeresströmung.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Desconcierta al enemigo provocando una espesa\nniebla que se convierte en su perdición. Las\ncorrientes marinas son su fuente de energía.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Avvolge il nemico in una fitta nebbia che\nlo induce ad attaccare se stesso. Le correnti\nmarine sono la fonte della sua energia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The dense fog it creates brings the downfall\nand destruction of its confused enemies.\nOcean currents are the source of its energy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "深い霧で　敵を　惑わせ\n自滅させる　恐ろしさを　持つ。\n海流が　エネルギーの　源。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "拥有利用浓雾迷惑敌人，\n让其自我毁灭那种程度的可怕。\n海流是其能量的来源。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Desconcierta al enemigo provocando una espesa\nniebla que se convierte en su perdición. Las\ncorrientes marinas son su fuente de energía.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みずを　あやつる　ポニの　まもりがみ。\nけがれを　はらう　きよらかな　みずを\nうみだすと　つたえられている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "물을 조종하는 포니의 수호신.\n부정을 없애는 깨끗한 물을\n만들어낸다고 전해져 온다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "操縱水的波尼守護神。\n傳說會生出能夠除去污穢的清淨之水。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gardien de Poni, il a le pouvoir de contrôler l’eau.\nOn raconte qu’il peut produire une eau limpide\nqui nettoie toutes les impuretés.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Schutzpatron von Poni. Dieses Pokémon\nkontrolliert das Wasser. Man sagt, es könne\nschmutziges in klares Wasser verwandeln.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es el espíritu guardián de Poni y tiene control\nsobre el agua. Dicen que puede purificar\ncualquier impureza con su agua límpida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Protettore di Poni, ha il potere di controllare\ni flutti. Si narra che possa generare acqua\nlimpidissima che neutralizza qualsiasi impurità.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The guardian deity of Poni, it can control water.\nPeople say it can create pure water that will\nwash away any uncleanness.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "水を　操る　ポニの　守り神。\nけがれを　払う　清らかな　水を\n生みだすと　伝えられている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "操纵水的波尼的守护神。\n传说会生出去除污秽的清澈之水。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es el espíritu guardián de Poni y tiene control\nsobre el agua. Dicen que puede purificar\ncualquier impureza con su agua límpida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふかい　きりの　おくに　すんでいると\nおそれ　うやまわれてきた。　みずを\nあやつる　ポニの　まもりがみだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "짙은 안개 속에 살고 있다고\n두려움과 존경을 받아 왔다.\n물을 조종하는 포니의 수호신이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棲息在濃霧的深處，\n受到了人們的敬畏。\n能夠操縱水，是波尼的守護神。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gardien de Poni et maître de l’eau, il vit au plus\nprofond de la brume. C’est notamment pour\ncette raison qu’il est à la fois craint et vénéré.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Als Schutzpatron von Poni kontrolliert es das\nWasser und lauert im dichten Nebel. Es wird\ngleichermaßen gefürchtet wie respektiert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El espíritu guardián de Poni, temido y venerado\na la vez. Mora en una espesa niebla y manipula\nel agua a su antojo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Protettore di Poni, ha il potere di controllare i\nflutti. Vive in una fitta nebbia, venerato e temuto\nallo stesso tempo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This guardian deity of Poni Island manipulates\nwater. Because it lives deep within a thick fog,\nit came to be both feared and revered.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "深い　霧の　奥に　棲んでいると\n恐れ　敬われてきた。　水を\n操る　ポニの　守り神だ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "栖息在浓雾深处而被人们敬畏着。\n是操纵着水的波尼的守护神。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El espíritu guardián de Poni, temido y venerado\na la vez. Mora en una espesa niebla y manipula\nel agua a su antojo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "まもりがみと　よばれるが　むやみに\nちかづく　あいてには　おそろしい\nわざわいを　もたらすこともある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "수호신으로 불리지만 무턱대고\n다가오는 상대에게는 무서운\n재앙을 가져다주는 일도 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "被稱為守護神，但有時\n會對隨便靠近自己的對手\n帶來恐怖的災難。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ne faut pas se laisser berner par son statut\nde divinité protectrice : il lui arrive de mettre en\npièces ceux qui osent s’approcher de trop près.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Man bezeichnet es zwar als Schutzpatron, doch\nall jene, die sich ihm unbedacht nähern, werden\nvon furchtbaren Katastrophen heimgesucht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A pesar de ser un espíritu guardián, trae\ndesgracias a aquellos que se le acercan sin la\ndebida cortesía.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È considerato un Pokémon protettore, ma a volte\narreca sciagure tremende a chi gli si avvicina in\nmodo avventato.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Although it’s called a guardian deity, terrible\ncalamities sometimes befall those who\nrecklessly approach Tapu Fini.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "守り神と　呼ばれるが　無闇に\n近付く　相手には　恐ろしい\n災いを　もたらすこともある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
